  ShowTopMostFoldoutHeaderGroup: 1
  ObjectiveList:
  - objectiveName: Enter Bank
    tasks:
    - rid: 2239482699065327976
    speakerName: Contractor
    speech: Might aswell mask up. Cops have been tipped off about a suscpicous van.
      45 seconds
  - objectiveName: Locate Vault
    tasks:
    - rid: 3958162936978735104
    speakerName: Contractor
    speech: Alright. Look around for the Vault
  - objectiveName: Disable Vault Seal
    tasks:
    - rid: 3958162936978735189
    - rid: 3958162936978735215
    speakerName: Contractor
    speech: Look for the offices, not the fancy ones, the cheap one. One of them
      should have access
  - objectiveName: Override Server Room Access
    tasks:
    - rid: 3958162936978735236
    - rid: 3958162936978735237
    speakerName: Contractor
    speech: The manager must have initiated a lockdown. Get to the server room and
      figure out how to stop this!
  - objectiveName: Disable Vault Seal
    tasks:
    - rid: 3958163091948306524
    speakerName: Contractor
    speech: Okay, lets try this one more time. Hack the managers computer
  - objectiveName: Loot the Vault
    tasks:
    - rid: 3958163091948306533
    speakerName: Contractor
    speech: Okay! That should do it. Get into the vault and secure the payday.
  - objectiveName: Escape
    tasks:
    - rid: 3958163091948306534
    - rid: 3958163091948306535
    speakerName: Contractor
    speech: Van is looping the block. Thirty seconds
